{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/vue/02_데이터바인딩/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<h2 id=\"vue-data-binding\" style=\"position:relative;\">Vue Data binding<a href=\"#vue-data-binding\" aria-label=\"vue data binding permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>뷰의 실시간 자동 렌더링 기능을 이용하려면 데이터 바인딩을 적극 활용하면 된다.<br>\nVue는 data가 변경되면 data와 관련된 HTML도 실시간으로 반영(재 랜더링)된다.</p>\n<p>자주 변하는 데이터들은 데이터로 보관하고 HTML에 {{꽂아넣는다}}</p>\n<h2 id=\"데이터-바인딩\" style=\"position:relative;\">데이터 바인딩<a href=\"#%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%84%B0-%EB%B0%94%EC%9D%B8%EB%94%A9\" aria-label=\"데이터 바인딩 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"vanilla-js-문법\" style=\"position:relative;\">Vanilla JS 문법<a href=\"#vanilla-js-%EB%AC%B8%EB%B2%95\" aria-label=\"vanilla js 문법 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\">document<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">getElementById</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>어쩌구<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>innerHTML <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> 데이터<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"vue-문법\" style=\"position:relative;\">vue 문법<a href=\"#vue-%EB%AC%B8%EB%B2%95\" aria-label=\"vue 문법 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>데이터를 어딘가에 보관하고, {{ 데이터 }} 문법으로 꽂아 넣는다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">{{콧수염}}</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"예제\" style=\"position:relative;\">예제<a href=\"#%EC%98%88%EC%A0%9C\" aria-label=\"예제 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">&lt;template&gt;\r\n  &lt;h4&gt;XX 원룸&lt;/h4&gt;\r\n  &lt;p&gt;{{price}} 만원&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/template&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;script&gt;\r\nexport default {\r\n  name: &#39;App&#39;,\r\n  data(){\r\n    return {\r\n      // 데이터 보관함\r\n      price1 : 60,\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  components: {}\r\n}\r\n&lt;/script&gt;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"html-속성-바인딩\" style=\"position:relative;\">HTML 속성 바인딩<a href=\"#html-%EC%86%8D%EC%84%B1-%EB%B0%94%EC%9D%B8%EB%94%A9\" aria-label=\"html 속성 바인딩 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>HTML 모든 속성도 데이터 바인딩이 가능하다.<br>\nHTML의 속성을 바인딩 할때에는 {{콧수염}} 이 아니라 : 콜론을 붙여준다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">&lt;template&gt;\r\n  &lt;h4 class=&quot;red&quot; :style=&quot;스타일&quot;&gt;XX 원룸&lt;/h4&gt;\r\n&lt;template&gt;\r\n  \r\n&lt;script&gt;\r\nexport default {\r\n  name: &#39;App&#39;,\r\n  data(){\r\n    return {\r\n      스타일 : &#39;color:blue&#39;,\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  components: {}\r\n}\r\n&lt;/script&gt;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"예제-1\" style=\"position:relative;\">예제<a href=\"#%EC%98%88%EC%A0%9C-1\" aria-label=\"예제 1 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">&lt;template&gt;\r\n  &lt;img alt=&quot;Vue logo&quot; src=&quot;./assets/logo.png&quot;&gt;\r\n  &lt;div&gt;\r\n    &lt;h4&gt;{{products[0]}}&lt;/h4&gt;\r\n    &lt;p&gt;50 만원&lt;/p&gt;\r\n  &lt;/div&gt;\r\n  &lt;div&gt;\r\n    &lt;h4&gt;{{products[1]}}&lt;/h4&gt;\r\n    &lt;p&gt;70 만원&lt;/p&gt;\r\n  &lt;/div&gt;\r\n  &lt;div&gt;\r\n    &lt;h4&gt;{{products[2]}}&lt;/h4&gt;\r\n    &lt;p&gt;70 만원&lt;/p&gt;\r\n  &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/template&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;script&gt;\r\nexport default {\r\n  name: &#39;App&#39;,\r\n  data(){\r\n    return {\r\n      products : [&#39;역삼동원룸&#39;, &#39;천호동원룸&#39;, &#39;마포구원룸&#39;],\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  components: {}\r\n}\r\n&lt;/script&gt;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#vue-data-binding\">Vue Data binding</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%84%B0-%EB%B0%94%EC%9D%B8%EB%94%A9\">데이터 바인딩</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#vanilla-js-%EB%AC%B8%EB%B2%95\">Vanilla JS 문법</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#vue-%EB%AC%B8%EB%B2%95\">vue 문법</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#%EC%98%88%EC%A0%9C\">예제</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#html-%EC%86%8D%EC%84%B1-%EB%B0%94%EC%9D%B8%EB%94%A9\">HTML 속성 바인딩</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#%EC%98%88%EC%A0%9C-1\">예제</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>","fields":{"gitLastModified":"Oct 2, 2026"},"frontmatter":{"title":"02. vuedongsan 데이터 바인딩","summary":"Vue Data binding 뷰의 실시간 자동 렌더링 기능을 이용하려면 데이터 바인딩을 적극 활용하면 된다. Vue는 data가 변경되면 data와 관련된 HTML도 실시간으로 반영(재 랜더링)된다. 자주 변하는 데이터들은 데이터로 보관하고 HTML에 {{꽂아넣는다}}","date":"Jun 12, 2023","categories":["VUE"],"tags":[],"author":["a